GPL separation
--------------

BlackHole and joycast.driver are GPL-3.0 components of the separate virtual
audio driver. No GPL source is copied into or linked with the noican
application. When a renamed driver is distributed, its corresponding driver
source and GPL notices must be published separately. Obtain legal review for
combined distribution with a non-GPL app, or use a commercial BlackHole license.
